#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:8
msgid "How to run, configure, and implement a Satellite app that speaks SAP."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment modes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:12
msgid "Hub learns about Satellites in two ways:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed (config + systemd)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare a process in `~/.anima/config.yaml`. `anima service start/stop/restart` writes `anima-satellite-<name>.service` user units (when systemd is available) and starts/stops them with `anima.service`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"satellites:\n"
"  chat:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/chat/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4174\"\n"
"  pair-programming:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"satellites/pair-programming/dev.ts\"]\n"
"    env:\n"
"      STUDIO_WORKSPACE: /path/to/project\n"
"      SATELLITE_PORT: \"4173\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field              | Role                                             |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `command` / `args` | Process to run (required for managed satellites) |\n"
"| `env`              | Extra environment variables                      |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:40
msgid ""
"Working directory is derived by anima from the install layout (monorepo root "
"or CLI package root), not configured here."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup:** managed satellites start only after Hub `GET /api/health` returns `status: ok`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:44
msgid ""
"See [service.md](../guide/service.md) for systemd unit paths and startup "
"order."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic (SAP connect)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:48
msgid ""
"No `command` in config. Start the satellite yourself; it connects to Hub via "
"SAP WebSocket. Instances appear on Chamber → Satellites after connect."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:50
msgid "There is **no** global `studio:` section in `config.yaml`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:52
msgid ""
"Open managed satellite UI at the URL from Chamber (SAP `http_url`), "
"typically:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:55
msgid "Chat: `http://127.0.0.1:4174`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:55
msgid "Pair-programming: `http://127.0.0.1:4173`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite access modes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Rule:** each `app_id + instance_id` has **at most one** Hub WebSocket (`/sap/v1`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type B — Process gateway + local relay (Chat, pair-programming)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:66
msgid ""
"Sidecar `createSatelliteHub({ relay: true, ... })` holds the sole Hub WS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:66
msgid "Browser uses `createSapRelayBrowserClient` → satellite `/sap/relay/v1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:66
msgid ""
"`instance_id` persisted under `~/.anima/satellites/{app}/instance.json`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:66
msgid ""
"**Chat:** relay only (no local tools). **Pair-programming:** relay + "
"`tool.register` + local FS/PTY APIs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type B + tools, no relay (companion)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:72
msgid ""
"Sidecar `createSatelliteHub({ relay: false, tools: [...] })` holds the sole "
"Hub WS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:72
msgid ""
"Browser talks to sidecar HTTP only (no SAP relay); tools execute in sidecar "
"(`bubble`, `play_slot`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:72
msgid ""
"`instance_id` in `~/.anima/companion/instance.json`; platform `sap:companion:"
"{id}`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph chat [Chat Type B relay]\n"
"    B1[Browser] -->|relay WS| Relay1[\"/sap/relay/v1\"]\n"
"    Relay1 --> ProcSAP1[createSatelliteHub]\n"
"    ProcSAP1 -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub1[Hub]\n"
"  end\n"
"\n"
"  subgraph ppy [Pair-programming Type B]\n"
"    B2[Browser] -->|relay WS| Relay2[\"/sap/relay/v1\"]\n"
"    Relay2 --> ProcSAP2[createSatelliteHub]\n"
"    ProcSAP2 -->|唯一 SAP WS| Hub2[Hub]\n"
"    B2 --> LocalFS[\"/api/studio/*\"]\n"
"    B2 --> LocalPTY[本地 terminal WS]\n"
"    ProcSAP2 --> ToolExec[tool executor]\n"
"  end\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Deprecated:** HTTP hub-api REST→SAP proxy (removed).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat satellite"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:96
msgid ""
"Browser connects via `createSapRelayBrowserClient` → [`/sap/relay/v1`](../../"
"satellites/chat/server/index.ts); sidecar uses `createSatelliteHub` with "
"`relay: true` and no local tools ([`satellites/chat/server/sap/hub.ts`]"
"(../../satellites/chat/server/sap/hub.ts)). `conversation.list` / "
"`conversation.create` omit explicit `platform`; Hub defaults to the connected "
"instance's `sap:chat:{id}`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pair-programming satellite"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:100
msgid ""
"Browser connects via `createSapRelayBrowserClient` → [`/sap/relay/v1`](../../"
"satellites/pair-programming/server/index.ts); sidecar uses "
"`createSatelliteHub` ([`satellite-hub.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/"
"satellite-hub.ts))."
msgstr ""

