#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minimal SAP client"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:112
msgid ""
"Use `runSapTransport` or `createSatelliteHub` from `@freeanima/sap-contract`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (typescript)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import { createSatelliteHub, fileSapInstanceStore } from \"@freeanima/sap-contract\";\n"
"\n"
"const hub = createSatelliteHub({\n"
"  appId: \"my-app\",\n"
"  hubUrl: process.env.FREEANIMA_URL ?? \"http://127.0.0.1:2658\",\n"
"  httpUrl: `http://127.0.0.1:${process.env.SATELLITE_PORT ?? 4173}`,\n"
"  instanceStore: fileSapInstanceStore(\"/path/to/instance.json\"),\n"
"  relay: false,\n"
"  tools: [],\n"
"  onConnected: async () => {\n"
"    /* optional conversation.create — connect does not auto-create conversations */\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:130
msgid ""
"On first connect omit `instance_id`; Hub assigns a 3-char id and returns it "
"in `connected.instance_id`. Persist via `SapInstanceStore.save`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:132
msgid ""
"Browser UI on Type B relay satellites uses `createSapRelayBrowserClient()` "
"instead of talking to Hub directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:134
msgid ""
"Transport handles WebSocket open, `connect` handshake, heartbeat, and "
"reconnect with exponential backoff."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable                                  | Role                                         |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_URL`                           | Hub HTTP base URL                            |\n"
"| `SATELLITE_PORT`                          | Satellite HTTP listen port                   |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_HOME`                          | Data root (`~/.anima`); instance store paths |\n"
"| `STUDIO_WORKSPACE`                        | Pair-programming workspace root              |\n"
"| `STUDIO_GITIGNORE` / `STUDIO_SHOW_HIDDEN` | File tree filters                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layer dependencies"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:148
msgid ""
"Per [`.agent/rules/code-layers.md`](../../.agent/rules/code-layers.md) "
"(Dependency allow/deny matrix): `satellites/*` may depend only on "
"`@freeanima/sap-contract`, `@freeanima/kernel`, and `kernel-*` packages. Do "
"not import `platform`, `runtime`, `core`, or `capabilities-*` from Satellite "
"code."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:149
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chamber visibility"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:152
msgid ""
"`GET /api/satellites/status` (Chamber → Satellites) reads "
"`SatelliteManager.getStatus()`: connected instances, `http_url`, registered "
"tools, heartbeat timestamps."
msgstr ""

